    rectangle "==Layered World\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nCoordinates and key packing (x, y, z), tile rules as data (TILE_INFO), and chunked terrain: the forest surface at z = 0 from noise octaves, solid geology below with one shaft per chunk. Chunks are generated lazily and LRU-cached; player edits (richness mods), per-layer fog and the holes between layers live outside the cache." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.LayeredWorld
    rectangle "==State and Saves\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\ncreateState() builds the state; serialize/deserialize write and validate a JSON save (format v5; other versions are rejected). state.events is transient and never saved." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.StateandSaves
    rectangle "==Simulation Step\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nstep(s, dt): extractor production, range-limited logistics auto-collect on the player's layer, the abundance trickle, and hash-seeded regrowth near the player. Also movement, fog reveal and the day/night curve." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.SimulationStep
    rectangle "==Actions\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nHarvest (gather deposits on the surface, dig rock underground), Trail sweep targets, collect, and build; plus travel between layers through holes (dig down from the forest, climb up through the ceiling, drop through holes and shafts). All work on the player's own layer." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.Actions
    rectangle "==Stockpile\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nWhat you own as piles around home, on a logarithmic scale: one pile per unit of each digit, each power of ten its own kind, biggest nearest home; from 10^7 a pile covers a square of tiles one wider per power. Laid out over explored ground (grass first) by a cost-ordered spiral; the ground grid can be memoized between layouts. Pure: only a picture of the inventory." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.Stockpile
    rectangle "==Catalog\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nEverything that exists in the game, by the id a texture pack knows it by: tiles, resources, buildings, the wanderer, marks, buttons, upgrades, perks and colours, each with what it does and the slots a pack can fill. Built from the other content tables, so a new tile or upgrade can't go undocumented." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.Catalog
